==Strategies==
==='''Chapters 1 & 2'''===
Start by stalling the enemies with [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] to save up cash. Send out some AoE attackers to kill the peons once you're ready, and start spawning [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and other heavy hitters. If you have any [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien units]] such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]]'s [[True Form]], definitely bring them.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Make sure that there is always something in range of the Elder Sloth (preferably a meatshield) so its speed doesn't make the best of you. Take advantage of Elder Sloth's long time between attacks to put status effects on it to make it easier. Use tanks (such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]]) or fast attackers to kill the Elder Sloth. Make sure you have most of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|anti-Alien Treasures]] before attempting this stage!

